  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "As Spectral Soul is about to enter the Gu, Ying Wu Xie grabs him and uses lead soul into dream, and Fang Yuan’s soul leaves Ying Wu Xie’s body and enters the rank nine Immortal Gu instead.",
        "chapters": [
          1018
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "entry-at-yi-tian-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ying_wu_xie",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s soul enters the Gu and is drawn in. Outside, the Gu runs through a long sequence of light and weather changes until a baby forms, lands, and grows into a sixteen-year-old body suited to his soul. Fang Yuan names the use as revival, with rank six cultivation level on that new body, and states that Spectral Soul had painstakingly created the Gu for that end.",
        "chapters": [
          1021
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "revival-body",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later notes that this body has no parents and no origin in another person, and guesses that, being formed from the Gu, it might count as an Immortal Gu. His body passes freely through the Five Regional Mountain Range’s imitations of the regional walls, where a Southern Border Gu Immortal should meet repulsion, and that is what the guess would explain.",
        "chapters": [
          1043
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "revival-body",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_five_regional_mountain_range",
          "reg_southern_border",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Sixth Hair later tells him that heaven’s will wants him dead because his revived body and immortal aperture have unlimited potential and will let him surpass the previous venerables once he grows.",
        "chapters": [
          1075
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "revival-body",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_sixth_hair"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ying Wu Xie recalls that when Shadow Sect designed sovereign immortal fetus Gu’s recipe, his main body had already planned for the five regional walls, so Fang Yuan can not only pass them now but freely change his aura to become a Gu Immortal of any of the five regions. Fang Yuan crosses the Southern Border regional wall with zero obstruction and calls the effect mystical, confirming it for himself.",
        "chapters": [
          1044
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "design-intent-behind-the-five-regional-walls",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shadow_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Watching Hei Lou Lan, a strength path Gu Immortal, use fire path methods without dao mark conflict, Fang Yuan guesses it comes from Shadow Sect’s methods, since Spectral Soul Demon Venerable designed sovereign immortal fetus Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1257
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "a-design-that-may-reach-beyond-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan reasons that because of sovereign immortal fetus Gu, Shadow Sect will not let him off, and that letting the sect grow instead of destroying it risks him ending up like Ma Hong Yun.",
        "chapters": [
          1354
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "why-shadow-sect-will-not-let-him-go",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ma_hong_yun"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Purple Mountain True Monarch tells Fang Yuan the sovereign immortal body’s huge flaw is food: though it has flesh and blood, the essence of a rank nine Immortal Gu remains in it, so like a rank nine Immortal Gu it must be fed.",
        "chapters": [
          1371
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "a-flaw-it-must-be-fed",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan considers mimicking Shadow Sect to create a second sovereign immortal fetus Gu for his clone, but Shadow Sect spent a hundred thousand years refining the first, making a second basically impossible.",
        "chapters": [
          1481
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "a-second-one-is-basically-impossible",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
